{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 0, "text_idx": 36, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 195, "chars": 265, "max_new_tokens": 444, "t_start": 1790292470.192, "latency": 11.456, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 652844, "out_tokens": "171", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "366", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "171", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "537", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "75", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 444}, "params": {}, "text": "I have to admit something, and it's not easy for me. I don't admit things very often. Last week, I was playing golf with my caddie, a young guy, very nice, and I told him, I'm going to beat you by ten strokes. Ten! And I lost. I lost to the caddie. By four strokes.", "audio_s": 13.6, "rtf": 0.842, "s_per_word": 0.247, "s_per_letter": 0.0697, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.877, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "8add02d7bd4b62b3b53dc3baa3ba3a4670c5e00367203d96c7df31f36fc880f0", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/000.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 1, "text_idx": 37, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 56, "letters": 217, "chars": 286, "max_new_tokens": 491, "t_start": 1790292470.196, "latency": 12.74, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 721964, "out_tokens": "189", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "361", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "189", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "550", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "70", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 491}, "params": {}, "text": "And everybody at the club heard about it. Everybody. I walked into the dining room and it got very quiet. Very quiet. People were looking down at their soup. I'll be honest with you, I was embarrassed. But I'll get him next time. I gave him a very big tip, though. A very, very big tip.", "audio_s": 15.04, "rtf": 0.847, "s_per_word": 0.269, "s_per_letter": 0.0693, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.872, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "6ba91a86582e3e97c6e7c64561ca08cfa9fbc332f6c0e246b3e6e560fc2d5cf5", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/001.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 2, "text_idx": 38, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 56, "letters": 205, "chars": 278, "max_new_tokens": 466, "t_start": 1790292470.198, "latency": 12.972, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 725804, "out_tokens": "190", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "366", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "190", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "556", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "75", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 466}, "params": {}, "text": "Whoa! What is this? What's going on here? I walk into the room, the lights are off, and all of a sudden, everybody jumps out! Surprise! I had no idea. No idea! Look at this cake. This is the biggest cake I've ever seen. It's got my face on it! Who made this? This is incredible.", "audio_s": 15.12, "rtf": 0.858, "s_per_word": 0.27, "s_per_letter": 0.0738, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.928, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "7123f66782b3b692d91846cd111609b7731bf87b73f810239dc78d987aa2528f", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/002.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 3, "text_idx": 39, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 211, "chars": 279, "max_new_tokens": 478, "t_start": 1790292470.2, "latency": 11.282, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 633644, "out_tokens": "166", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "360", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "166", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "526", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "69", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 478}, "params": {}, "text": "I've never been so surprised in my life, and I've been surprised a lot, believe me. You people, you really got me. You got me good. I thought I was coming in for a meeting about the budget! And there are balloons! Look at all these balloons! Who did all this? I can't believe it!", "audio_s": 13.2, "rtf": 0.855, "s_per_word": 0.24, "s_per_letter": 0.0626, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.787, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "6a57e44b8bf9fab848965e9fa1d7f31ee51767d2d8b08811e9f4b896b8f09b7c", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 40, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 59, "letters": 247, "chars": 320, "max_new_tokens": 556, "t_start": 1790292470.201, "latency": 14.115, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 814124, "out_tokens": "213", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "365", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "213", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "578", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "74", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 556}, "params": {}, "text": "Listen to me. Listen very carefully. Because I'm only going to say this once. This is the greatest deal. In the history of deals. Maybe ever. Nobody has seen anything like it. Nobody. And when people look back on this day, many years from now, they're going to say, that was the day. That was the day everything changed.", "audio_s": 16.96, "rtf": 0.832, "s_per_word": 0.287, "s_per_letter": 0.0687, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.864, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "fb682d604aeee58ae865982140c99fd63ed6767a6c2b37d110f51f031ef81aba", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 41, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 66, "letters": 268, "chars": 348, "max_new_tokens": 601, "t_start": 1790292470.203, "latency": 14.17, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 810284, "out_tokens": "212", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "372", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "212", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "584", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "81", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 601}, "params": {}, "text": "Let me explain how a deal works, because a lot of people don't understand it. First, you never want to look like you need the deal. Never. Second, you aim very high, and then you keep pushing. Third, you always have a way out. Always. And fourth, and this is the most important one, you have to know the other side better than they know themselves.", "audio_s": 16.88, "rtf": 0.839, "s_per_word": 0.256, "s_per_letter": 0.063, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.792, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "9e46ff17538fbdcbd5256ecbbe99cb87759e97951b5c13c9c8480550a81be796", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 6, "text_idx": 42, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 225, "chars": 297, "max_new_tokens": 508, "t_start": 1790292470.205, "latency": 14.042, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 794924, "out_tokens": "208", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "365", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "208", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "573", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "74", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 508}, "params": {}, "text": "We have the best buildings, the best golf courses, the best hotels, the best restaurants, the best steaks, the best everything. And people say, how do you do it? How do you do it all? And I say, it's easy, you hire the best people, you work harder than everybody else, and you never, ever give up.", "audio_s": 16.56, "rtf": 0.848, "s_per_word": 0.291, "s_per_letter": 0.0736, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.926, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "9f6cd82d598bd848826bda5884b6536010cc78ede2336ab1812da7843f02932b", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/006.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 7, "text_idx": 43, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 217, "chars": 287, "max_new_tokens": 491, "t_start": 1790292470.207, "latency": 12.633, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 706604, "out_tokens": "185", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "362", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "185", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "547", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "71", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 491}, "params": {}, "text": "I get up early, I make my calls, I have my meetings, I go to the construction site, I check the marble, I check the windows, I check everything. Then I have lunch, a quick lunch, and I do it all again. More calls, more meetings, more deals. Every single day. Nobody works harder. Nobody.", "audio_s": 14.72, "rtf": 0.858, "s_per_word": 0.268, "s_per_letter": 0.0678, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.853, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "30911f3894446e1a5367176ed1575f043e8e426eaf8104d3a177a023640ab8cf", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/007.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 8, "text_idx": 44, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 60, "letters": 282, "chars": 368, "max_new_tokens": 631, "t_start": 1790292470.209, "latency": 15.27, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 971564, "out_tokens": "254", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "380", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "254", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "634", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "89", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 631}, "params": {}, "text": "Okay, okay, we have a lot to cover, so let's go, let's go. Hotels, doing great. Golf courses, doing great, record numbers. Restaurants, fantastic, people are lining up around the block. The new tower, ahead of schedule, under budget, nobody's ever done that. The ratings, through the roof, bigger than ever. The steaks, the best steaks, everybody's talking about them.", "audio_s": 20.24, "rtf": 0.754, "s_per_word": 0.337, "s_per_letter": 0.0718, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.903, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "8485dfc7802ea7cf034ac177a113483fd09dd9031d69d8e4f887910405cc7ebd", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/008.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 9, "text_idx": 45, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 55, "letters": 234, "chars": 308, "max_new_tokens": 528, "t_start": 1790292470.21, "latency": 14.042, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 791084, "out_tokens": "207", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "366", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "207", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "573", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "75", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 528}, "params": {}, "text": "The water, beautiful water, crystal clear. The vodka, well, we don't talk about the vodka. But everything else, winning, winning, winning. I could go on for hours, I really could, but they tell me we only have a few minutes, so I'm going fast, very fast, faster than anybody's ever gone. Is that fast enough?", "audio_s": 16.48, "rtf": 0.852, "s_per_word": 0.3, "s_per_letter": 0.0704, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.886, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "bf11b3f9748b62719b69c500df5fa4344e2671361b8ece6319993eeb7c7bcd02", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/009.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 10, "text_idx": 46, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 225, "chars": 296, "max_new_tokens": 508, "t_start": 1790292470.212, "latency": 13.076, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 741164, "out_tokens": "194", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "363", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "194", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "557", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "72", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 508}, "params": {}, "text": "Let me tell you something, and I want you to listen. There are people out there, competitors, who think they can beat us. They think they can take what we built. Let me be very clear. That's not going to happen. Not today, not tomorrow, not ever. We know who they are. We know what they're doing.", "audio_s": 15.44, "rtf": 0.847, "s_per_word": 0.271, "s_per_letter": 0.0686, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.863, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "49fd6545daf3804ef471a9a8c682ea4cb46fcbe842dd950efd4e11d7fc40feda", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/010.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 11, "text_idx": 47, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 58, "letters": 209, "chars": 285, "max_new_tokens": 474, "t_start": 1790292470.214, "latency": 11.438, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 637484, "out_tokens": "167", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "368", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "167", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "535", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "77", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 474}, "params": {}, "text": "So this guy comes up to me, a little guy, very nervous, and he goes, oh, Mister Trump, Mister Trump, please, please, can I have a picture? Can I have a picture with you? And I said, sure, of course. And he says, oh, thank you, thank you so much, my wife is never going to believe this!", "audio_s": 13.28, "rtf": 0.861, "s_per_word": 0.229, "s_per_letter": 0.0635, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.799, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "9978a2e642235afac016ac207dd78ac2944843d46885496d8c7d77af382ab575", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/011.flac"}
{"run": "trump_long_c32_n32_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "long", "c": 32, "idx": 12, "text_idx": 48, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 57, "letters": 222, "chars": 293, "max_new_tokens": 502, "t_start": 1790292470.215, "latency": 12.718, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 718124, "out_tokens": "188", "resp_headers": {"x-vllm-omni-input-tokens": "363", "x-vllm-omni-output-tokens": "188", "x-vllm-omni-total-tokens": "551", "x-vllm-omni-input-text-tokens": "72", "x-vllm-omni-input-audio-tokens": "291"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 502}, "params": {}, "text": "And I said to them, you want the best? You want the very best? Then you came to the right place! Because we don't do small, we don't do average, we do tremendous! We do spectacular! When we build something, the whole world stops and looks. They say, how did they do that? How is that possible?", "audio_s": 14.96, "rtf": 0.85, "s_per_word": 0.262, "s_per_letter": 0.0674, "pace": 0.0795, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.848, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "d3c2c26fffdd3b8297150bc6250c1d5e6ad75016f354e45468393aa9ad0250fc", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/012.flac"}
